babeltrace
------------------------------------------
This project provides trace read and write libraries, as well as a trace
converter. A plugin can be created for any trace format to allow its conversion
to/from another trace format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbabeltrace-devel-1.5.11-1bl2
  libbabeltrace1-1.5.11-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libpopt-devel-1.19-1
  libpopt0-1.19-1
  libuuid-devel-2.40.2-2
  libuuid1-2.40.2-2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libpopt-devel-1.19-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuuid-devel-2.40.2-2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1
  swig-4.5.1-1

Canonical website:
  https://babeltrace.org/

Canonical download:
  https://www.efficios.com/files/babeltrace/babeltrace-1.5.11.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack babeltrace-1.5.11-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./babeltrace-1.5.11-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/babeltrace-1.5.11-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/babeltrace-1.5.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbabeltrace1-1.5.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbabeltrace-devel-1.5.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-babeltrace-1.5.11-X.tar.xz

